.cache/
.work-in-progress/

# Generated architecture diagrams (local tooling output, not versioned)
docs/architecture/package-architecture.html

# Local-only reference / personal notes (not versioned)
# - vpn-proxy note is a per-workstation baseline (self-declared local-only)
# - design-system-gallery is a regenerable claude.ai design import: large binaries
#   (multi-MB JPEGs) and raw-color mocks that trip the DS guardrail
# - the management-plane workplan is the owner-side record of the real opera and
#   admin FQDNs. product_250 §2 keeps those names out of this repo (the edge
#   serves a wildcard cert so they never reach CT logs), and the file says so
#   itself — it is untracked on purpose, not by omission. It stays readable in
#   place; ignoring it only stops `git add -A` from staging it. Committing it
#   anyway would still fail CI on the ops-hostname rule in
#   scripts/guardrails/check-public-repo-hygiene.mjs — this is the convenience
#   layer, that is the guarantee.
/vpn-proxy-claude-cli-baseline.md
packages/design/design-system-gallery/
/workplans/mgmt-plane-contract-capability-console.md

# End of additional ignores
